WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:06.450
Adam was attempting to use the power 
of the gods to accomplish some goal.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.940
What goal is that?

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.170
In order to rule the planet,

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:15.400
he would destroy the coffin that surfaces 
from beyond the horizon of time.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.650
That's pretty... bone-chilling.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.810
Gear Blast!

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:50.600
G3FA! Hexa-Revolver!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.240
So that's a Custodian...

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:05.710
The body of an Anunnaki, 
the ones they called gods...

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:09.530
What they call a holy corpse.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:56.530
<b>Episode 2
The Day The Sky Falls</b>

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.310
Okay, I'm off to school.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:17.370
It's so cold... 
It's worse than a mini-ice age!

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:18.870
Chris-chan!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.660
Morning! It's another freezing day, huh?

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.040
It sure is.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.380
Yeah!

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:29.100
But those gloves sure look warm!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.610
Stop bringing it up every day, dummy!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:35.870
You're going too far, getting that excited.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:41.720
But it feels like Chris-chan likes 
the gloves we chose together.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:45.230
She wears them to school every day.

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:49.090
You're right. She's already got 
accepted into college, too.

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.670
That's because, um...

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:55.160
I haven't been to school as much as 
the rest of you, so I need to...

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:03.210
But... my fun times at school 
may be coming to an end.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:23.530
Something seems to be distracting her.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.120
Y-Yes, indeed.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:29.190
We're using the valuable time we have 
between missions, but just look at her.

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:32.300
Her big comeback concert 
is in three days, too!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.600
Good work.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:38.710
Not really.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:43.670
I know you're worried about another 
threat approaching the Earth.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.670
But the stage is another place 
where you fight, right?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.580
That's right.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:53.560
But after what happened on our 
way back from the South Pole...

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:57.210
Is this really where I belong?

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.570
What's the situation?

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.560
Alca-Noise detected over the Pacific Ocean.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:08.340
The American carrier 
<i>Thomas Whitmore</i> is under attack.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:11.560
So they're after the body
 we recovered at the South Pole?

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:14.320
That's what they get for refusing our offer.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.570
Shirabe and Kirika were on standby. 
Where are they?

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.330
On their way.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.180
I can't believe you forgot your LiNKER!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.720
Glad you remembered!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.100
Time to make up for that mistake!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:47.390
<i>Zeios Igalima raizen tron.</i>

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.120
DEATH!

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:35.450
<i>I'm firing off Happy + Go Lucky x Heavy bass!</i>

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.450
<b>Kill Juliet</b>

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:41.170
<i>The girl who's too cute, so 
she wants to eat meat, is here</i>

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.660
<i>A scythe typhoon ripping and tearing</i>

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:47.610
<i>Even though it makes me dizzy</i>

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.050
<b>Δ Charming Axel Killer</b>

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:53.170
<i>I'm always ready for a fight, 
always doing my best</i>

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:59.420
<i>When our songs overlap 
for the final fight song</i>

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:58.690
The Alca-Noise are no match for 
Shirabe-san and Kirika-san.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.470
Yeah. Which means...

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:05.310
<i>we'll rip apart even the tallest 
wall and create the future</i>

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.900
<i>Our dreams won't lose</i>

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:12.440
<i>Push through it with your strong love</i>

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:13.450
<i>Ready go!</i>

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.820
<i>But I won't run away!</i>

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:25.660
<i>When I believed and overcame, 
my tears became stars</i>

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:32.880
<i>Now illuminate the dark, 
hope, light, and support</i>

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:40.490
<i>The one you're waiting for 
will go with you! Twin Heart!</i>

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.430
<b>Sever Stab Dracula</b>

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.480
Kiri-chan!

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:50.090
That's the one who summoned 
the Alca-Noise...?

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:51.980
An Alchemist!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.370
Just like we thought.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:59.990
Yeah. The remnants of the 
Bavarian Illuminati were behind this.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.440
I shall humbly serve as your opponent.

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:06.460
Yeah?

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.090
Death!

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:09.430
Kiri-chan!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:11.470
Act sane for once!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.080
If she wants to play tag, 
I'll use the Shul Shagana!

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:31.840
Attachment!

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.320
Nail! Penetrate her!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.120
Shirabe!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.720
It doesn't matter how many 
Noise you have now...

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.630
That was too easy.

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:03.210
Symphogears made from destroying 
perfect life can't be this weak...

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.600
Did she...

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:12.280
Someone changed me.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:15.730
Someone made me strong.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.300
I can't lose that easily!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:26.580
<i>With a shining blade</i>

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:30.290
<i>Cabbage cut in half</i>

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:36.250
<i>I did extra homework on how to slaughter you</i>

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:42.770
<i>I'll run through the field with 
high output and full strength</i>

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:48.700
<i>I dive in with my all for 
both my dreams and my fights</i>

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.480
<b><i>β </i>Massive Circle Slash</b>

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:55.480
<i>Let's sing when our songs overlap</i>

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:53.520
If I downsize, it doesn't matter 
if it's cramped in here!

00:09:55.480 --> 00:10:01.770
<i>We'll rip apart even the tallest 
wall and create the future</i>

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.130
Shirabe!

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:04.630
<i>Our dreams won't lose</i>

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:07.540
That attack's too poorly aimed to hit me!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:10.000
<i>Push through it with your
 strong love, ready go!</i>

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:16.470
<i>I may be inexperienced and incomplete, 
but I won't run away</i>

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.620
No way!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:22.630
<i>When I believed and overcame, 
my history became stars</i>

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:29.660
<i>Now illuminate this moment
 with light and support</i>

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:34.190
<i>See, someone's waiting for you</i>

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:38.950
<i>Let's go together! Twin Heart!</i>

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:47.250
We did it, Kiri-chan!

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.460
We'll have hamburg steak for dinner tonight!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.450
You didn't do it!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:56.970
I was going easy on you because 
I was prioritizing my mission.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.530
<i>That's right, Eliza-chan.</i>

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:02.240
<i>You can't overdo it and sink both 
the ship and the holy corpse.</i>

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.910
<i>You should retreat.</i>

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:07.310
Retreat? So easily?

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:11.370
The mission is not important enough 
to risk my dear Eliza-chan getting hurt.

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:16.480
Roger that. Returning to base.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.930
I guess... we won?

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:28.960
If nothing else, we protected 
that creepy mummy.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.720
Send a rescue team immediately.

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:36.160
A new threat that opposes the world.

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:43.210
Shouldn't we be protecting the 
corpse we recovered at the South Pole?

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:45.320
I understand how you feel.

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:49.340
But the world leaders decided that America

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:52.200
would take the lead on 
investigating the corpse.

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.050
Several countries don't want
 the Japanese government

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:57.730
or S.O.N.G. getting any more closely
 involved with the relics.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:01.930
If we were allowed to defend it, 
we could've limited the damage...

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:02.820
Ow!

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:06.270
Focus on what you're doing, 
and what you can do now.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:11.530
Standing on the stage and singing is 
an important job of yours, right?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:15.300
I hate to admit it, but you're right.

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:18.670
But on one condition.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.410
<i>I read the report.</i>

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.650
<i>Even if there was political intervention,</i>

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:30.870
<i>how pathetic that you would 
allow a valuable sample</i>

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:35.310
<i>of a precursor civilization 
to be taken by the Americans!</i>

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:39.280
We should have been more careful
 around the US government,

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:42.170
which has been very aggressive
 in its interference,

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.830
including using reactive weapons.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:50.080
<i>And you still haven't finished 
off the Bavarian Illuminati.</i>

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.330
We are dealing with that.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:56.550
<i>Do not bring shame to the blood of 
the protectors that runs within you.</i>

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.910
Commander, I brought you some warm tea.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.700
Thank you for the tea.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.120
Sorry about that...

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:12.350
Kamakura's never really 
scolded us like that before.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.550
But now they're doing it an awful lot.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:17.470
Yes, you're right.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.580
It's Tsubasa-san's comeback concert!

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.510
And we haven't been to a concert in forever!

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:28.900
But we won't make it at this rate!

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:31.060
What do you want?

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:32.840
There's a traffic jam!

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.210
Maria said she couldn't 
come all of a sudden, too.

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.590
When you're unlucky, you're really unlucky.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.940
Maria? Do they mean...

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:14.110
<i>I swear here that I will never break</i>

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:25.270
<i>Our songs (Our songs) will 
resound high in the sky</i>

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:30.260
That's impossible! I can't do that!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:33.770
You said you wanted to sing all 
night with me, didn't you?

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:36.210
But, I...

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:38.800
I love singing.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.410
What about you, Maria?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:52.740
<i>Exposed again and again to 
the endlessly blowing winds</i>

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:56.600
<i>But even so, the dreams 
that bloomed passionately</i>

00:14:56.600 --> 00:15:05.130
<i>give me the courage to take a step forward, and then another</i>

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:10.120
<i>The sound of love passed down 
in this voice (this heart)</i>

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:15.560
<i>The feathers that fell 
when an angel took flight</i>

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:20.330
<i>And now they'll dwell within me</i>

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:26.740
<i>Wings to fly in a world of chaos</i>

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:33.820
<i>Fly high as long as you have 
a place to come home to</i>

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:38.800
<i>There's nothing to fear in 
journeying towards your dreams</i>

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:43.920
<i>Ten billion stars and none are alike</i>

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:47.310
<i>What does it mean to live?</i>

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:49.910
<i>What does it mean for my heart to beat?</i>

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:59.380
<i>It's to play a song towards the 
future in a color that's your own</i>

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:07.730
<i>Shine and turn your life into a song!</i>

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:26.640
<i>It feels like artist and audience 
have truly become one...</i>

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:32.310
<i>Like the miracle the song of 
my homeland caused that day.</i>

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.250
This is...

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:03.470
Alca-Noise signals detected in the 
concert hall near the coast!

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.290
Send the Wielders now! 
Ready the helicopter!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.420
No!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:31.890
<i>Imyuteus Ame no Habakiri tron.</i>

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:04.120
Everyone, calm down!

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:05.610
Follow our instructions and―

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:07.500
No! I'm running!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:09.030
Move! Get out of the way! Make way!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.360
The remnants of the Illuminati...

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.080
Alca-Noise at the stadium?

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:22.070
But Tsubasa-san is there...

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:26.550
Right! A helicopter is on
 its way to pick you up!

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:31.890
<i>Board it and head to the scene immediately!</i>

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:33.490
Hibiki, look!

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:41.230
What are the alchemists thinking, 
sending Alca-Noise to a concert?

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:56.110
Fear! Tremble! I'm here!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.480
It begins now! 
And I'm gonna pull it off perfectly!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:05.390
My target is you, Tsubasa Kazanari!

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.650
A survivor of the Illuminati...

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:09.980
Don't taint songs with your blood!

00:19:13.780 --> 00:19:16.970
I'd appreciate it if you 
just let me kill them all!

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.420
Shut up!

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:23.050
Tsubasa, don't follow her too far in!

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:42.610
What?

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.960
Well done, Tsubasa Kazanari!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.820
We are weak and incomplete. 
We can't defeat you.

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:52.050
Weak?

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:53.760
Yes. We're weak!

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:57.730
That's why we're not ashamed to do this!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.130
Seal Invasion!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.450
You bitch!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.980
All my hairs are standing up!

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.760
Time for me to go!

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:36.970
I'm going to slice you apart!

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:38.220
Calm down!

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:41.010
There are still people here 
who haven't escaped.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.600
Time for me to turn tail and run!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:07.660
We've lost track of the alchemist.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:12.450
That concert hall held 
100,000 people, and it collapsed.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.800
Checking for life signs...

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:34.180
Maria-san! Tsubasa-san!

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:37.650
<i>I couldn't protect them!</i>

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:42.930
<i>All the things that matter 
slip through my hands...</i>

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:34.260
Record! And report! Hurry!

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:35.340
Understood!
